The Barangay Juncarlo shall be bounded as follows:
Beginning at point marked 1 of Barangay Juncarlo, Municipal Government of San Andres, Romblon, being
N-40-51 E, 4954.30 M from BLLM No. 1, San Andres Subdivision PLS 874 hence:
Thence S53-31 E 119.403 M to point 2;
Thence S16-45W 1075.641 M to point 3;
Thence S14-41E 868.33 M to point 4;
Thence S86-29W 1302.66 M to point 5;
Thence S48-07W 778.97 M to point 6;
Thence N37-54W 848.54 M to point 7;
Thence N7-29W 768.53 M to point 8;
Thence N10-18W 670.82 M to point 9;
Thence N8-45W 131.53 M to point 10;
Thence N3-58W 192.35 M to point 11;
Thence N5-42W 602.99 M to point 12;
Thence N5-42W 602.99 M to point 13;
Thence N62-06E 1154.12 M to point 14;
Thence N64-12E 1010.79 M to point 15;
Thence S0-24W 1430.03 M to point 1;
of beginning.
All points marked on the ground by old B.L. Cyl. concrete monuments. Bounded on the east along lines 1, 2,
and 3 by Barangay Marigondon Norte; on the east and south, along lines 3, 4, 5 and 6 by Barangay Pagalad;
along lines 10, 11 and 12 by Barangay Calunacon; on the west or north, along lines 12, 13, and 14 by
Barangay Linawan, and the north and east along lines 14 and 15 by Barangay Marigondon Norte.
